<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#CECDC3;--shiki-dark:#CECDC3;">    PLUGIN_CODE Test                  </span><span style="--shiki-light:#CECDC3;--shiki-dark:#CECDC3;"># unique, 4 characters, exactly one upper-case</span></span>
